<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys 1.88 mln shares on market.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys 1.88 mln shares on market.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom New Zealand Limited said on Wednesday it bought 1.88 million shares on the market during Tuesday as part of its ongoing buyback scheme, at prices ranging between NZ$6.68 and $6.72.</p>
<p>The operation is set to continue until the company advises it has concluded the current phase of purchases.</p>
<p>--Wellington newsroom +64 4 471 4273</p>
</text>
